format 1

# Seeded by `pklith seed --init` from the fragments this repository's
# files switch on (`pklith detect`). It is yours now: pklith never rewrites it.
#
# itok leaves the `*` row: `.context-limits` holds sherd's per-chain
# ceilings (paradigm/V12, root T4); itok reads the same file as per-file
# ceilings with another tokenizer, so the two disagree on every row, as
# nix-codebuff and nix-orca found. sherd-budget gates the ceilings.

## checks
id|category|nix|glob|check|fix|env|msg
# The registry judges itself, as in pklith, actlith and lablith: generated
# steps match .pklith, and every tracked file type has a row.
gen-check|gate|-|.pklith, hk.pklith.pkl, nix/pklith.nix|pklith gen --check|pklith gen|-|hk.pklith.pkl or nix/pklith.nix no longer matches .pklith; run pklith gen
pklith-check|gate|-|-|pklith check|-|-|a tracked file type has no row in .pklith, a row matches nothing, or a claimed check never reaches its files
# paradigm/V37, dev V3: no committed file holds a name from the local,
# untracked .private/denylist; without one (CI) it holds.
name-guard|gate|-|**/*|cargo run -q -p chertmem-dev -- name-guard {{files}}|-|-|a committed file holds a name from .private/denylist
# paradigm/V15, dev V4: core.worktree in the shared .git/config redirects
# every worktree; the step refuses it.
no-core-worktree|gate|-|**/*|cargo run -q -p chertmem-dev -- no-core-worktree|-|-|core.worktree is set in the shared .git/config; unset it
# dev V5: flake.lock holds one nixpkgs and one nixpkgs-lock node, so every
# input follows the fleet pin (paradigm/V20).
lock-graph|gate|-|flake.lock, flake.nix|cargo run -q -p chertmem-dev -- lock-graph|-|-|flake.lock holds more than one nixpkgs or nixpkgs-lock node

# Offline, as in lablith: advisories need a fetched database, so they wait
# for the push and CI steps (root T12).
deny|supply|cargo-deny|Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, deny.toml|cargo deny check --disable-fetch licenses bans sources|-|-|a license, ban or source rule failed
# Every member, not only the root package: without --workspace the dev
# crate's examples never run.
doctest|test|cargo|**/*.rs, Cargo.toml|cargo test --workspace --doc -q|-|-|a doc example failed
## types
type|checks|min|exempt
*|trailing-whitespace, final-newline, line-endings, no-bom, no-merge-conflict, no-case-conflict, no-broken-symlinks, no-private-key, ripsecrets, typos, editorconfig-checker, no-local-paths, name-guard, no-core-worktree|-|-
editorconfig|-|-|written by pklith (seed or gen)
gitattributes|-|-|written by pklith (seed or gen)
md|markdownlint|-|-
nix|nixfmt, statix, deadnix|-|-
path:**/SPEC.md|markdownlint, mth-fmt, mth-check, sherd-check, sherd-nav, sherd-budget|-|-
path:.context-limits|sherd-budget|-|-
pklith|pklith-check, gen-check|-|-
pkl|-|-|written by pklith (seed or gen)
pre-commit|-|-|written by pklith (seed or gen)
pre-push|-|-|written by pklith (seed or gen)
envrc|shellcheck|-|-
gitignore|-|-|git configuration; no linter reads ignore patterns
path:flake.lock|lock-graph|-|-
markdownlintignore|-|-|ignore patterns, no linter reads them
rs|rustfmt, clippy, doctest|-|-
toml|taplo|-|-
path:Cargo.lock|deny|-|-
path:.markdownlint.yaml|-|-|markdownlint configuration; yamllint arrives with the workflows (root T12)
